01:29.690 --> 01:32.439
♪No regrets whether laughter or tears♪

01:32.440 --> 01:35.239
♪I never stop searching♪

01:35.240 --> 01:38.460
♪I never stop falling♪

01:41.020 --> 01:44.130
♪A furious roar shakes the earth
and pierces the sky♪

01:53.760 --> 01:56.799
=Sword and Fairy 3=

01:56.800 --> 01:58.759
=Episode 10=
=Battle of Leizhou=

01:58.760 --> 02:01.480
(Assisting the Supreme Authority)

02:12.580 --> 02:13.819
Wow.

02:13.820 --> 02:15.420
You look great in that.

02:15.820 --> 02:17.140
Of course.

02:17.780 --> 02:18.540
Xuejian.

02:18.820 --> 02:19.740
Do I look handsome?

02:19.940 --> 02:22.540
Do I look like a swordsman
from the Shu Mountain?

02:22.820 --> 02:23.540
Well...

02:23.660 --> 02:25.100
It's passable.

02:25.420 --> 02:26.380
Not bad.

02:26.680 --> 02:28.060
Though you're a lay disciple,

02:28.220 --> 02:29.460
you look the part now.

02:29.670 --> 02:30.779
From today on,

02:30.780 --> 02:33.300
I'm officially
one of the Shu Mountain Sect.

02:33.640 --> 02:34.960
Then, let's go to morning practice.

02:36.840 --> 02:38.560
I'll go grab some food first.

02:38.600 --> 02:39.880
You focus on training.

02:39.920 --> 02:41.840
I'll bring some over for you later.

02:42.080 --> 02:44.559
I'll show Xuejian around.

02:44.560 --> 02:45.879
Take in the sights of Shu Mountain.

02:45.880 --> 02:46.720
All right.

02:47.040 --> 02:49.400
Make sure you come
watch me practice in this outfit.

02:51.820 --> 02:55.280
So which flashy
sword technique are we learning first?

03:11.280 --> 03:12.720
Changqing,

03:12.760 --> 03:15.640
aren't we practicing
sword techniques today?

03:20.960 --> 03:22.719
This is the foundation of swordsmanship.

03:22.720 --> 03:24.040
Stay focused.

03:26.560 --> 03:27.919
Jing Tian,

03:27.920 --> 03:29.679
why are you the only one
doing horse stance?

03:29.680 --> 03:30.759
Go, Jing Tian.

03:30.760 --> 03:32.640
You even look cool doing horse stance.

03:32.820 --> 03:34.260
Thanks.

03:43.540 --> 03:46.860
When will I finally get to practice
Shu Mountain sword techniques?

03:49.460 --> 03:54.060
(Leizhou City)

03:55.820 --> 03:58.140
The weather in Leizhou
is really strange.

03:58.220 --> 03:59.980
It keeps thundering, but never rains.

04:00.060 --> 04:01.740
And demons keep showing up.

04:02.180 --> 04:03.279
Stay sharp.

04:03.280 --> 04:04.499
That stretch of wall

04:04.500 --> 04:06.340
is the most dangerous spot.

04:07.340 --> 04:08.339
Monsters always

04:08.340 --> 04:09.299
climb up from there.

04:09.300 --> 04:09.899
Brother,

04:09.900 --> 04:11.220
stop scaring me.

04:12.840 --> 04:13.699
Relax.

04:13.700 --> 04:16.940
Leizhou is under
the Thunder Deity's protection.

04:16.980 --> 04:18.540
It's peaceful enough.

04:20.220 --> 04:20.819
Quick!

04:20.820 --> 04:22.100
Draw your swords!

04:33.740 --> 04:35.620
Thunder Deity?

04:52.780 --> 04:54.139
Thank you, Thunder Deity.

04:54.140 --> 04:55.620
Thank you, Thunder Deity!

05:11.250 --> 05:14.030
(Yun Chuiye)

05:17.700 --> 05:19.820
(Yun Ting)

05:28.620 --> 05:29.419
Immortal Master,

05:29.420 --> 05:32.060
the Thunder Spirit Pearl
should be inside Leizhou City.

05:32.180 --> 05:34.339
But the city is easy to defend
and hard to take.

05:34.340 --> 05:37.019
Prefect Yun Chuiye
is stubborn and inflexible.

05:37.020 --> 05:38.140
I'm afraid...

05:38.180 --> 05:41.659
Go inform General Shi's
demon forces to prepare.

05:41.660 --> 05:45.259
Tell him our investigation
shows Leizhou will fall soon.

05:45.260 --> 05:48.300
The Thunder Spirit Pearl
will be within reach.

06:07.020 --> 06:08.140
Look.

06:08.700 --> 06:11.219
These murals were left
by Shu Mountain's forebears.

06:11.220 --> 06:14.180
They tell of the Five Spirit Pearls
and the Demon-Sealing Pagoda.

06:14.540 --> 06:15.940
More than 300 years ago,

06:15.980 --> 06:17.900
the Demon Emperor
plagued the mortal realm.

06:18.020 --> 06:20.700
Even the entire Shu Mountain Sect
could not defeat him.

06:21.140 --> 06:24.180
So they lured him
into the Demon-Sealing Pagoda,

06:24.580 --> 06:26.340
suppressing him
with the Demon-Subduing Sword

06:26.980 --> 06:29.980
and setting the Five Elements Array
outside the tower.

06:30.220 --> 06:32.820
Now, the Demon-Sealing Pagoda
has been breached.

06:33.140 --> 06:35.760
Master and the four Elders
are draining their spiritual power

06:35.760 --> 06:39.080
to sustain the Five Elements Array,
holding the demons inside for now.

06:39.080 --> 06:40.900
But it cannot last.

06:41.180 --> 06:43.260
Fortunately,
you brought back a Spirit Pearl.

06:43.460 --> 06:45.300
With the Earth Spirit Pearl restored,

06:45.340 --> 06:48.860
Uncle He Yang can step out briefly
to divine the others.

06:49.660 --> 06:50.699
Changqing,

06:50.700 --> 06:52.540
after the Five Spirit Pearls are used...

06:52.620 --> 06:55.820
Once their power is spent,
they disappear.

06:56.740 --> 06:58.139
What a pity.

06:58.140 --> 07:01.380
They will gather
the world's spiritual energy and reform.

07:01.660 --> 07:02.780
But

07:03.300 --> 07:05.660
that will take ages.

07:08.140 --> 07:11.300
Uncle He Yang divined that
a Spirit Pearl may appear in the south,

07:11.340 --> 07:13.540
so disciples were sent to investigate.

07:13.700 --> 07:15.140
We have word now

07:15.420 --> 07:18.660
that the Thunder Spirit Pearl
may be in Leizhou.

07:19.010 --> 07:20.059
Then, let's leave at once

07:20.060 --> 07:21.460
and find it.

07:21.960 --> 07:22.819
Yes.

07:22.820 --> 07:24.400
Repair the Demon-Sealing Pagoda
as soon as possible,

07:24.400 --> 07:26.620
and the five Elders
will regain their freedom.

07:29.660 --> 07:31.739
Changqing, before we head down the mountain,

07:31.740 --> 07:33.859
you have to teach me
more Shu Mountain sword techniques.

07:33.860 --> 07:35.220
I will do all I can.

07:35.700 --> 07:36.620
It's a deal.

07:40.820 --> 07:41.940
Zi Xuan,

07:42.000 --> 07:43.619
you've just recovered
from serious injuries.

07:43.620 --> 07:45.419
Stay on Shu Mountain and rest.

07:45.420 --> 07:46.820
Wait for our news.

07:47.500 --> 07:48.460
Alright.

08:06.220 --> 08:07.100
Again.

08:13.830 --> 08:15.289
♪Blades of wind cut through dark clouds♪

08:15.290 --> 08:16.689
♪Sunset flares to life♪

08:16.690 --> 08:18.720
♪Staining the vast sky red♪

08:20.140 --> 08:21.260
Changqing,

08:21.300 --> 08:22.279
(Immortal Wind Cloud Form Technique,
Shu Mountain Alchemy Text)

08:22.280 --> 08:24.169
The Immortal Wind Cloud Form Technique
is not bad.

08:24.170 --> 08:25.060
Learn that.

08:25.140 --> 08:26.670
I also want to learn some talisman arts.

08:27.160 --> 08:28.619
Why am I inside the Demon Sword again?

08:28.620 --> 08:30.740
If you want
to truly master swordsmanship,

08:31.060 --> 08:33.020
you must ingrain
every move in your heart.

08:33.190 --> 08:35.619
♪The sword's edge ignites
with burning blood♪

08:35.620 --> 08:38.660
Until your body reacts
without conscious thought.

08:39.740 --> 08:41.379
Within the Demon Sword's domain,

08:41.380 --> 08:42.580
time flows slower than outside.

08:44.500 --> 08:46.300
It will make your training
twice as effective.

08:47.210 --> 08:50.029
♪I never stop searching♪

08:50.030 --> 08:53.480
♪I never stop falling♪

08:55.710 --> 08:59.070
♪A furious roar shakes the earth
and pierces the sky♪

09:10.360 --> 09:12.839
♪A flying sword
like a phoenix in flight♪

09:12.840 --> 09:15.280
♪Dancing high
across the highest heavens♪

09:15.840 --> 09:18.459
♪Pale moon, the blade's chilling edge♪

09:18.460 --> 09:21.249
♪Piercing through longing and thought♪

09:21.250 --> 09:24.099
♪The cold flame honed upon the blade♪

09:24.100 --> 09:26.680
♪Still burns with unyielding resolve♪

09:27.660 --> 09:29.980
It's not hard to memorize
a sword technique inside and out.

09:30.100 --> 09:30.979
What is hard

09:30.980 --> 09:32.619
is seizing the right moment

09:32.620 --> 09:34.149
and choosing the proper move

09:34.150 --> 09:36.099
to unleash its full power.

09:36.100 --> 09:38.129
♪Burn to the fullest♪

09:38.130 --> 09:41.079
♪For the one I love♪

09:41.080 --> 09:43.799
♪No regrets whether laughter or tears♪

09:43.800 --> 09:46.549
♪I never stop searching♪

09:46.550 --> 09:49.910
♪I never stop falling♪

09:52.300 --> 09:55.469
♪A furious roar shakes the earth
and pierces the sky♪

09:55.470 --> 09:59.100
♪Cutting down the clamor
of my inner demons♪

09:59.330 --> 10:01.219
♪The keen blade leaves its sheath♪

10:01.220 --> 10:06.559
♪Through blades and fire,
I'll dare the trial♪

10:06.560 --> 10:10.400
♪Cutting down the clamor
of my inner demons♪

10:10.520 --> 10:12.639
♪The keen blade leaves its sheath♪

10:12.640 --> 10:17.699
♪Through blades and fire,
I'll dare the trial♪

10:17.700 --> 10:20.459
♪Fight to the fullest♪

10:20.460 --> 10:23.459
♪Burn to the fullest♪

10:23.460 --> 10:26.179
♪For the one I love♪

10:26.180 --> 10:28.899
♪No regrets whether laughter or tears♪

10:28.900 --> 10:31.789
♪I never stop searching♪

10:31.790 --> 10:35.030
♪I never stop falling♪

10:37.460 --> 10:41.230
♪A furious roar shakes the earth
and pierces the sky♪

10:50.940 --> 10:52.060
(It worked!)

11:13.220 --> 11:16.020
Judging from the news Jing Tian
and the others brought back,

11:16.220 --> 11:19.459
(Qing Wei, Shu Mountain)
the Evil Sword Immortal should creat

11:19.460 --> 11:22.219
(Cang Gu, Shu Mountain Elder)
demonic cores that can greatly boost strength

11:22.220 --> 11:25.460
or give the illusion of being full
when he was  inside the tower.

11:25.620 --> 11:29.979
He uses them to build his power
in the mortal realm.

11:29.980 --> 11:32.899
Lately, while He Yang
is overseeing matters,

11:32.900 --> 11:35.619
there have been
frequent signs of this force.

11:35.620 --> 11:40.179
The disciples we sent
may not be able to endure for long.

11:40.180 --> 11:43.060
(You Xuan, Shu Mountain Elder)
The day Demon-Sealing Pagoda is restored

11:43.180 --> 11:46.720
is the day we face
the Evil Sword Immortal in battle.

11:46.720 --> 11:49.160
(Jing Ming, Shu Mountain Elder)
The demon has already gained strength.

11:49.160 --> 11:51.780
The outcome of that battle is uncertain.

11:51.840 --> 11:56.099
He escaped only days ago
and has already formed a spirit body.

11:56.100 --> 11:58.789
If he reaches the point
where he can strip away

11:58.790 --> 12:01.100
the original power that came from us,

12:01.380 --> 12:06.180
we will not even have
the chance to perish with him.

12:06.220 --> 12:09.940
The Evil Sword Immortal's calamity
was our fault to begin with.

12:10.300 --> 12:14.139
No matter the cost, we must bear it.

12:14.140 --> 12:17.740
As cultivators, we do not fear death.

12:18.900 --> 12:22.899
We can only hope it does not come
to the worst possible end.

12:22.900 --> 12:24.220
Changqing,

12:24.300 --> 12:28.780
when that day comes,
what choice will you make?

12:53.820 --> 12:55.020
Hurry!

13:06.140 --> 13:08.060
Get inside the city, quick!

13:08.380 --> 13:11.100
(Leizhou)
Keep up, move faster!

13:15.900 --> 13:16.699
Excuse me,

13:16.700 --> 13:18.260
what's happening in the city?

13:18.780 --> 13:19.979
Can't you hear the drums?

13:19.980 --> 13:21.299
Demons are attacking!

13:21.300 --> 13:22.739
Get inside if you want to stay alive.

13:22.740 --> 13:24.219
Keep calm.

13:24.220 --> 13:25.380
Demon?

13:30.860 --> 13:38.899
Thunder Deity, protect us.
Drive away the evil.

13:38.900 --> 13:41.140
Thunder Deity, protect us.

14:22.820 --> 14:23.899
Luo Rulie?

14:23.900 --> 14:25.380
What is he doing here?

14:25.420 --> 14:27.860
Are they trying
to seize the Spirit Pearl?

14:40.220 --> 14:42.820
Yun Chuiye, Prefect of Leizhou,

14:43.140 --> 14:44.500
hear me clearly!

14:44.920 --> 14:47.780
I, Luo Rulie,
offer terms before I strike.

14:48.220 --> 14:51.269
Surrender the city
and hand over the Thunder Spirit Pearl,

14:51.270 --> 14:53.960
and I will spare
every living thing within.

14:53.980 --> 14:55.370
Otherwise,

14:57.180 --> 15:01.020
I will level Leizhou
and leave nothing alive!

15:01.580 --> 15:05.539
(Protect the land and the people)
Leizhou has stood for a century without falling.

15:05.540 --> 15:08.579
We do not fear demons like you.

15:08.580 --> 15:11.660
When did he gather so many demons?

15:13.820 --> 15:14.779
Changqing,

15:14.780 --> 15:17.379
these demons are nothing
like the ones we faced before.

15:17.380 --> 15:18.259
They move in formation

15:18.260 --> 15:19.580
and act as one.

15:19.700 --> 15:21.060
Like an army.

15:21.590 --> 15:23.300
Can Leizhou hold?

15:23.830 --> 15:25.739
Luo Rulie came
for the Thunder Spirit Pearl.

15:25.740 --> 15:27.620
He must be well prepared.

15:28.140 --> 15:29.259
There is no time to waste.

15:29.260 --> 15:30.860
We must call Shu Mountain for support.

15:31.620 --> 15:33.060
Go.

15:35.460 --> 15:36.579
Good.

15:36.580 --> 15:39.500
I was afraid you would not dare face me.

15:42.700 --> 15:45.860
Level Leizhou!

15:52.260 --> 15:53.619
Generals, hear my command!

15:53.620 --> 15:56.060
Do not let
a single demon enter the city!

16:00.500 --> 16:01.620
Fire!

16:59.260 --> 17:01.179
Before the Shu Mountain Sect,

17:01.180 --> 17:03.260
these lesser demons are no match.

17:04.060 --> 17:06.180
Are you a swordsman
from the Shu Mountain?

17:07.620 --> 17:08.740
Freeze.

17:08.940 --> 17:10.060
Down.

17:12.420 --> 17:13.620
Impressive.

17:18.140 --> 17:19.960
I am a sword immortal
from the Shu Mountain,

17:19.960 --> 17:21.939
slaying demons and upholding the Way
in the mortal realm.

17:21.940 --> 17:23.819
I have mastered peerless arts,

17:23.820 --> 17:26.340
riding immortal winds
to the highest heavens.

17:27.300 --> 17:29.180
Demon Register, back.

17:54.100 --> 17:55.420
(So many demons.)

17:55.540 --> 17:57.500
(Can Leizhou really hold out?)

17:58.740 --> 17:59.859
Thunderstones.

17:59.860 --> 18:00.980
Release!

18:01.300 --> 18:03.260
Looks like Leizhou was ready.

18:11.300 --> 18:13.100
Demon King, the situation...

18:34.420 --> 18:36.460
Do not celebrate too soon.

18:36.540 --> 18:39.180
The real show is yet to come.

19:04.340 --> 19:06.139
I am Xu Changqing
of the Shu Mountain Sect.

19:06.140 --> 19:07.540
Greetings, Prefect Yun.

19:08.220 --> 19:10.299
They are Jing Tian and Tang Xuejian.

19:10.300 --> 19:12.250
- Greetings, Prefect Yun.
- Greetings, Prefect Yun.

19:12.330 --> 19:14.290
So you are disciples of Shu Mountain.

19:14.330 --> 19:15.929
Pardon me, I didn't recognize you.

19:15.930 --> 19:17.810
We seek your assistance in a matter.

19:19.530 --> 19:20.769
This is not the place to speak.

19:20.770 --> 19:21.890
Come,

19:22.050 --> 19:25.410
escort our honored guests
to the Prefect's residence.

19:26.050 --> 19:28.930
We will speak further shortly.

19:31.170 --> 19:32.450
This way, please.

20:23.740 --> 20:25.019
Unite sword and qi,

20:25.020 --> 20:26.500
ride the sword and soar.

20:26.740 --> 20:27.660
Rise!

20:29.180 --> 20:30.420
It worked!

20:31.420 --> 20:32.580
Jingjing.

20:53.780 --> 20:57.059
♪War flames rise,
the mountains and rivers tremble♪

20:57.060 --> 21:00.379
♪Reincarnation begins,
cause and effect fall into chaos♪

21:00.380 --> 21:04.059
♪The night grows thick, dark as ink♪

21:04.060 --> 21:07.259
♪The wheel of fate starts
to turn backward♪

21:07.260 --> 21:10.419
♪Crimson palace walls,
stained with blood and tears♪

21:10.420 --> 21:14.099
♪Vows scatter with the wind,
fading into the clouds♪

21:14.100 --> 21:17.819
♪Moonlight cannot pierce this darkness♪

21:17.820 --> 21:24.299
♪Who cries out in loneliness
from the abyss♪

21:24.300 --> 21:27.779
♪The net of destiny tightens ever more♪

21:27.780 --> 21:31.259
♪The lock of karma
binds a lifetime unbroken♪

21:31.260 --> 21:34.659
♪Love and hate entwined beyond escape♪

21:34.660 --> 21:38.059
♪Not awaken in a world of chaos♪

21:38.060 --> 21:41.419
♪Stars shatter, heaven and earth mourn♪

21:41.420 --> 21:44.939
♪Snow fills Shu Mountain,
only ruins remain♪

21:44.940 --> 21:48.299
♪Five elements in balance,
six realms side by side♪

21:48.300 --> 21:51.619
♪All for the sake of the living♪

21:51.620 --> 21:56.420
♪Stepping onto a path of no return♪

22:12.370 --> 22:16.730
(Next episode preview)
Night is when the Demon Clan reigns.

22:18.770 --> 22:21.290
All troops, prepare to engage!

22:26.290 --> 22:28.849
Thunder Deity...Thunder...

22:28.850 --> 22:30.610
The Thunder Spirit Pearl
is with Yun Ting.

22:31.370 --> 22:31.889
This is bad.

22:31.890 --> 22:33.130
Yun Ting is in danger.

22:33.250 --> 22:34.090
I will save him.

22:36.090 --> 22:37.810
I am going with you to save Yun Ting.
